{"3726260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Catch&Cargo", "steam_appid": 3726260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You lost the house, the big-city life, the wife, and the kids—all to a betting app you swore you’d delete.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since then, it’s been a blur of overdue tabs, dockside bunks, and mornings spent trying to remember what hope felt like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you saw it:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><u>“Fisher wanted. No experience. No boat. Tropics.”</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You clicked. They replied. Against all logic—you’re going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/9bcb1ef05304bd3503a44760ce1136e5.poster.avif?t=1787776385\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/9bcb1ef05304bd3503a44760ce1136e5.webm?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/9bcb1ef05304bd3503a44760ce1136e5.mp4?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch and Cargo is a first-person fishing and boating semi-sim with survival elements, set in remote tropical waters. You arrive with empty pockets, a photo of your family, a mountain of debt—and a quiet hope to start over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operate small fishing boats with realistic physics: fuel weight, cargo balance, wind, and current all matter.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/c3978be34a7058e455416b1e60519c8d.poster.avif?t=1787776385\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/c3978be34a7058e455416b1e60519c8d.webm?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/c3978be34a7058e455416b1e60519c8d.mp4?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catch fish using rods, nets, and sonar. Some fish fight back. Some fight dirty.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/b981c86d3ee569af191bc6650fdee85c.poster.avif?t=1787776385\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/b981c86d3ee569af191bc6650fdee85c.webm?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/b981c86d3ee569af191bc6650fdee85c.mp4?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take jobs hauling cargo across open water. Load poorly, and you’ll feel it in the waves—or not feel anything at all.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/23823ac217ef566a3a13e17cd4103dc1.poster.avif?t=1787776385\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/23823ac217ef566a3a13e17cd4103dc1.webm?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/23823ac217ef566a3a13e17cd4103dc1.mp4?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stay alive: drink water, find food, sleep when you can. Exhaustion hits harder at sea.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/bc420e665479173ff5c3c216d0508e0a.poster.avif?t=1787776385\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/bc420e665479173ff5c3c216d0508e0a.webm?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/bc420e665479173ff5c3c216d0508e0a.mp4?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your boat—shift furniture, hang photos, place mugs, and make it feel like yours.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/2be24061013f12f36182e92f180655b5.poster.avif?t=1787776385\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/2be24061013f12f36182e92f180655b5.webm?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/2be24061013f12f36182e92f180655b5.mp4?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a home on the island, piece by piece. No rush. No blueprint. Just something to come back to.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/9d91b8ad7fa68e2863a9dc3e7ab45122.poster.avif?t=1787776385\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/9d91b8ad7fa68e2863a9dc3e7ab45122.webm?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/9d91b8ad7fa68e2863a9dc3e7ab45122.mp4?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not about winning. It’s about working your way out—of the debt, the shame, the mess you made—and maybe, maybe finding something worth staying afloat for.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You lost the house, the big-city life, the wife, and the kids—all to a betting app you swore you’d delete.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since then, it’s been a blur of overdue tabs, dockside bunks, and mornings spent trying to remember what hope felt like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you saw it:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><u>“Fisher wanted. No experience. No boat. Tropics.”</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You clicked. They replied. Against all logic—you’re going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/9bcb1ef05304bd3503a44760ce1136e5.poster.avif?t=1787776385\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/9bcb1ef05304bd3503a44760ce1136e5.webm?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/9bcb1ef05304bd3503a44760ce1136e5.mp4?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch and Cargo is a first-person fishing and boating semi-sim with survival elements, set in remote tropical waters. You arrive with empty pockets, a photo of your family, a mountain of debt—and a quiet hope to start over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operate small fishing boats with realistic physics: fuel weight, cargo balance, wind, and current all matter.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/c3978be34a7058e455416b1e60519c8d.poster.avif?t=1787776385\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/c3978be34a7058e455416b1e60519c8d.webm?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/c3978be34a7058e455416b1e60519c8d.mp4?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catch fish using rods, nets, and sonar. Some fish fight back. Some fight dirty.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/b981c86d3ee569af191bc6650fdee85c.poster.avif?t=1787776385\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/b981c86d3ee569af191bc6650fdee85c.webm?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/b981c86d3ee569af191bc6650fdee85c.mp4?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take jobs hauling cargo across open water. Load poorly, and you’ll feel it in the waves—or not feel anything at all.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/23823ac217ef566a3a13e17cd4103dc1.poster.avif?t=1787776385\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/23823ac217ef566a3a13e17cd4103dc1.webm?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/23823ac217ef566a3a13e17cd4103dc1.mp4?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stay alive: drink water, find food, sleep when you can. Exhaustion hits harder at sea.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/bc420e665479173ff5c3c216d0508e0a.poster.avif?t=1787776385\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/bc420e665479173ff5c3c216d0508e0a.webm?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/bc420e665479173ff5c3c216d0508e0a.mp4?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your boat—shift furniture, hang photos, place mugs, and make it feel like yours.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/2be24061013f12f36182e92f180655b5.poster.avif?t=1787776385\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/2be24061013f12f36182e92f180655b5.webm?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/2be24061013f12f36182e92f180655b5.mp4?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a home on the island, piece by piece. No rush. No blueprint. Just something to come back to.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/9d91b8ad7fa68e2863a9dc3e7ab45122.poster.avif?t=1787776385\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/9d91b8ad7fa68e2863a9dc3e7ab45122.webm?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/extras/9d91b8ad7fa68e2863a9dc3e7ab45122.mp4?t=1787776385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not about winning. It’s about working your way out—of the debt, the shame, the mess you made—and maybe, maybe finding something worth staying afloat for.</p>", "short_description": "“Catch &amp; Cargo” is a first-person, single-player fishing and boating semi-simulator with survival elements, set in tropical waters. Catch and sell fish, deliver cargo, avoid storms, stay hydrated, and shed the “gringo” label as you adapt to the challenges of life on the open sea.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Greek, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/38f0f8fe0b012880edc33fd8388a75b5fe56371e/header.jpg?t=1787776385", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/d2fe39c54fb6e180420c34069102ff629211a455/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787776385", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726260/d2fe39c54fb6e180420c34069102ff629211a455/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787776385", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS: